      "dcterms:format": "application/json",
      "dcterms:description": "{\"action\":\"\",\"actor\":\"\",\"alternative_quotes\":[\"(1) Has been employed by the employer for at least 12 months, and\",\"(2) Has been employed for at least 1,250 hours of service during the 12-month period immediately preceding the commencement of the leave ( see § 825.801 for special hours of service requirements for airline flight crew employees), and\",\"(3) Is employed at a worksite where 50 or more employees are employed by the employer within 75 miles of that worksite. See § 825.105(b) regarding employees who work outside the U.S.\"],\"applies_to\":[],\"assertion_ids\":[\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:1c14f33b2e8bf86daaf667f7010fed0991c3710a0abba525b27591e3f9d5a214\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:6bcd38a47001b9fc3d3a9ffac52078e601d29642fc92110088843695cd2ebead\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:c4887def7e421814c9327ee6884c908323af0ffb2b6a5076bc63d23fedb4c356\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:741d406698f01cf662d559c3d676c072922529eae8838b7829186e482638373b\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:404756d91aa8588d92217f393777c7d695b3a2048ae85ed126c5661d122590c0\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:1aec694a19a2dad693ba187ce6135521c57bc223ec0cdac0e252f4cd037f7b1f\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:1260276791bd6d085d943b80ab58910d30ede5a9726e021a4a9e035a7f5dab1f\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:6d82ef21a2ad5814598926026d2190d0957b5b33470575d94955885aa48d1ad5\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:bcfb03d7b64faa167b96ff59a8000c32b2e9c78dc51b981e60a19ad596b509d6\"],\"choice_quote\":\"(a) An eligible employee is an employee of a covered employer who:\\n\\n(1) Has been employed by the employer for at least 12 months, and\\n\\n(2) Has been employed for at least 1,250 hours of service during the 12-month period immediately preceding the commencement of the leave ( see § 825.801 for special hours of service requirements for airline flight crew employees), and\\n\\n(3) Is employed at a worksite where 50 or more employees are employed by the employer within 75 miles of that worksite. See § 825.105(b) regarding employees who work outside the U.S.\",\"choice_text\":\"All three conditions must be satisfied: (1) employed by the employer for at least 12 months; AND (2) employed for at least 1,250 hours of service during the 12-month period immediately preceding the commencement of the leave (subject to special rules for airline flight crew employees); AND (3) employed at a worksite where 50 or more employees are employed by the employer within 75 miles of that worksite.\",\"claimants\":[],\"concepts\":[],\"context_quotes\":[\"(2) Has been employed for at least 1,250 hours of service during the 12-month period immediately preceding the commencement of the leave ( see § 825.801 for special hours of service requirements for airline flight crew employees), and\",\"(3) Is employed at a worksite where 50 or more employees are employed by the employer within 75 miles of that worksite. See § 825.105(b) regarding employees who work outside the U.S.\"],\"effective_periods\":[],\"end\":590,\"evidence\":[{\"end\":590,\"field\":\"summary\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aa4cdfc9b75c8a1ed78c29b8a344913757e4b95198a4b069127aa9092960aaf4f:37:590:sha256-e43d03081e43a5cd56466e06b1489af91ab5a4d901b3a2068f64e68e4fa8e5dd\",\"quote\":\"(a) An eligible employee is an employee of a covered employer who:\\n\\n(1) Has been employed by the employer for at least 12 months, and\\n\\n(2) Has been employed for at least 1,250 hours of service during the 12-month period immediately preceding the commencement of the leave ( see § 825.801 for special hours of service requirements for airline flight crew employees), and\\n\\n(3) Is employed at a worksite where 50 or more employees are employed by the employer within 75 miles of that worksite. See § 825.105(b) regarding employees who work outside the U.S.\",\"start\":37},{\"end\":590,\"field\":\"logic_text\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aa4cdfc9b75c8a1ed78c29b8a344913757e4b95198a4b069127aa9092960aaf4f:105:590:sha256-a4146cb35aab2ea08ee13739825b1cfce51ae8bb0f4f18bbc5d245db39a9923b\",\"quote\":\"(1) Has been employed by the employer for at least 12 months, and\\n\\n(2) Has been employed for at least 1,250 hours of service during the 12-month period immediately preceding the commencement of the leave ( see § 825.801 for special hours of service requirements for airline flight crew employees), and\\n\\n(3) Is employed at a worksite where 50 or more employees are employed by the employer within 75 miles of that worksite. See § 825.105(b) regarding employees who work outside the U.S.\",\"start\":105},{\"end\":64,\"field\":\"modality\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aa4cdfc9b75c8a1ed78c29b8a344913757e4b95198a4b069127aa9092960aaf4f:62:64:sha256-fa51fd49abf67705d6a35d18218c115ff5633aec1f9ebfdc9d5d4956416f57f6\",\"quote\":\"is\",\"start\":62},{\"end\":590,\"field\":\"choice_text\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aa4cdfc9b75c8a1ed78c29b8a344913757e4b95198a4b069127aa9092960aaf4f:37:590:sha256-e43d03081e43a5cd56466e06b1489af91ab5a4d901b3a2068f64e68e4fa8e5dd\",\"quote\":\"(a) An eligible employee is an employee of a covered employer who:\\n\\n(1) Has been employed by the employer for at least 12 months, and\\n\\n(2) Has been employed for at least 1,250 hours of service during the 12-month period immediately preceding the commencement of the leave ( see § 825.801 for special hours of service requirements for airline flight crew employees), and\\n\\n(3) Is employed at a worksite where 50 or more employees are employed by the employer within 75 miles of that worksite. See § 825.105(b) regarding employees who work outside the U.S.\",\"start\":37},{\"end\":103,\"field\":\"scope_text:0\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aa4cdfc9b75c8a1ed78c29b8a344913757e4b95198a4b069127aa9092960aaf4f:37:103:sha256-f65766fc8c1d9018ff7f6a685d59a802898d9b888c3de0a8c3c4756b5c8959a4\",\"quote\":\"(a) An eligible employee is an employee of a covered employer who:\",\"start\":37},{\"end\":406,\"field\":\"context:0\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aa4cdfc9b75c8a1ed78c29b8a344913757e4b95198a4b069127aa9092960aaf4f:172:406:sha256-f8c620c940dc57284f54426aad3bc219080834d541b71563d59c69ce9eeffe60\",\"quote\":\"(2) Has been employed for at least 1,250 hours of service during the 12-month period immediately preceding the commencement of the leave ( see § 825.801 for special hours of service requirements for airline flight crew employees), and\",\"start\":172},{\"end\":590,\"field\":\"context:1\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aa4cdfc9b75c8a1ed78c29b8a344913757e4b95198a4b069127aa9092960aaf4f:408:590:sha256-eb912ba3e3b8c4d1913a4740159f38d60c23793adb2467a188d1d44e8220b6ca\",\"quote\":\"(3) Is employed at a worksite where 50 or more employees are employed by the employer within 75 miles of that worksite. See § 825.105(b) regarding employees who work outside the U.S.\",\"start\":408},{\"end\":170,\"field\":\"alternative:0\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aa4cdfc9b75c8a1ed78c29b8a344913757e4b95198a4b069127aa9092960aaf4f:105:170:sha256-65892c2f4a4b04b4af78de1dd2934ed6701e42ce507cd493e35ac4d9a1ba80b0\",\"quote\":\"(1) Has been employed by the employer for at least 12 months, and\",\"start\":105},{\"end\":406,\"field\":\"alternative:1\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aa4cdfc9b75c8a1ed78c29b8a344913757e4b95198a4b069127aa9092960aaf4f:172:406:sha256-f8c620c940dc57284f54426aad3bc219080834d541b71563d59c69ce9eeffe60\",\"quote\":\"(2) Has been employed for at least 1,250 hours of service during the 12-month period immediately preceding the commencement of the leave ( see § 825.801 for special hours of service requirements for airline flight crew employees), and\",\"start\":172},{\"end\":590,\"field\":\"alternative:2\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aa4cdfc9b75c8a1ed78c29b8a344913757e4b95198a4b069127aa9092960aaf4f:408:590:sha256-eb912ba3e3b8c4d1913a4740159f38d60c23793adb2467a188d1d44e8220b6ca\",\"quote\":\"(3) Is employed at a worksite where 50 or more employees are employed by the employer within 75 miles of that worksite. See § 825.105(b) regarding employees who work outside the U.S.\",\"start\":408}],\"id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:revision:4dff5b286fbfa6ea281e073a059db513cfbba81f355e6c7fe7663cf57f98d6d3\",\"jurisdiction\":\"\",\"jurisdiction_quote\":\"\",\"kind\":\"definition\",\"logic_text\":\"(1) Has been employed by the employer for at least 12 months, and\\n\\n(2) Has been employed for at least 1,250 hours of service during the 12-month period immediately preceding the commencement of the leave ( see § 825.801 for special hours of service requirements for airline flight crew employees), and\\n\\n(3) Is employed at a worksite where 50 or more employees are employed by the employer within 75 miles of that worksite. See § 825.105(b) regarding employees who work outside the U.S.\",\"meaning_assertion_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:bcfb03d7b64faa167b96ff59a8000c32b2e9c78dc51b981e60a19ad596b509d6\",\"modality\":\"not_stated\",\"modality_quote\":\"is\",\"object\":\"\",\"occurrence_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:occurrence:0fc25e969491593058999b256ffa2920539ec9283168d62d434cb758a153ed3c\",\"origin\":\"aiSuggested\",\"quote\":\"(a) An eligible employee is an employee of a covered employer who:\\n\\n(1) Has been employed by the employer for at least 12 months, and\\n\\n(2) Has been employed for at least 1,250 hours of service during the 12-month period immediately preceding the commencement of the leave ( see § 825.801 for special hours of service requirements for airline flight crew employees), and\\n\\n(3) Is employed at a worksite where 50 or more employees are employed by the employer within 75 miles of that worksite. See § 825.105(b) regarding employees who work outside the U.S.\",\"references\":[\"§ 825.801\",\"§ 825.105(b)\"],\"relation\":\"none\",\"rule_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:rule:bded01a0efc757d10a2b8562f5141fb9f45e8cf0edfd417eabc2597cbc0a95b8\",\"scope_quotes\":[\"(a) An eligible employee is an employee of a covered employer who:\"],\"scope_text\":\"For an employee of a covered employer seeking to qualify as an eligible employee.\",\"section_id\":\"section-1\",\"start\":37,\"summary\":\"An eligible employee is an employee of a covered employer who has been employed by the employer for at least 12 months, has been employed for at least 1,250 hours of service during the 12-month period immediately preceding the commencement of the leave, and is employed at a worksite where 50 or more employees are employed by the employer within 75 miles of that worksite.\",\"target_ids\":[],\"typed_values\":[]}",
