een employed by the employer for at least 12 months.\"],\"scope_text\":\"When counting the 12 months an employee must have been employed by the employer, provided that employment periods prior to a break in service of seven years or more need not be counted except as provided in paragraph (b)(2).\",\"section_id\":\"section-1\",\"start\":592,\"summary\":\"The 12 months an employee must have been employed by the employer need not be consecutive months.\",\"target_ids\":[],\"typed_values\":[]}",
