      "rkaf:appliesInJurisdiction": [],
      "rkaf:applicabilityCondition": "In determining whether an employee has been employed by the employer for at least 12 months when an employment period precedes a break in service of more than seven years, where the break is occasioned by USERRA-covered service or where a written agreement exists concerning rehire."
    },
    {
